  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 4601.01 \"Able\" in the context of \"willing and able\" means the applicant possesses financial resources, equipment whether leased or owned, personnel, and a lawful place of business, that support the authority for which application is made.\n\nSource. #5852, eff 6-23-94; ss by #7240, eff 6-23-00, EXPIRED: 6-23-08\n\nNew. #9379, eff 1-30-09; ss by #12358, eff 8-2-17; ss by #13828, eff 12-22-23 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Saf-C 4600)",
